# Tern: Docs Propagation

When behavior or content changes, update in the same session:
- Content → run `npm run export:questions` (regenerates `docs/QUESTIONS.md`); log open questions in the world's `*-proposals.md`.
- Scoring or portrait logic → `docs/SCORING.md`.
- Engine, files or data shapes → `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Look, motion or flow → `docs/DESIGN.md`.
- Any ruling or lesson → append an entry to `AGENTS.md` (append-only; mark old entries [SUPERSEDED] or [AMENDED], never delete).
- What's done and what's next → `docs/NEXT-STEPS.md`.
